== Description ==

This is the long description. There is no limit, and you can use Markdown in this section.

A few notes about the sections above:

* "Contributors" is a comma-separated list of wp.org/wp-plugins.org usernames.
* "Tags" is a comma-separated list of tags that apply to the plugin.
* "Requires at least" is the lowest version that the plugin will work on.
* "Tested up to" is the highest version that you've successfully used to test the plugin.
* Stable tag should indicate the Subversion "tag" of the latest stable version.

== Installation ==

This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.

1. Upload `auto-slug-translate.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.
3. Place `<?php do_action('auto_slug_translate_hook'); ?>` in your templates.

