#Google Translate API

Auto Slug Translate plugin uses the Google Translate API to perform language translation. The plugin sends requests to the following API endpoint:

**Endpoint:** `https://translation.googleapis.com/language/translate/v2`

Please note that using the Google Translate API may be subject to terms of service and usage policies provided by Google. Ensure compliance with Google's terms and policies when using this feature.
